# Keep LF everywhere. The changelog is hash-chained over newline-delimited
# bytes; a CRLF conversion would change those bytes and break `engine verify`
# on a fresh checkout. Pin LF so verification is identical on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.json   text eol=lf
*.jsonl  text eol=lf
CHAIN    text eol=lf
